irst item is a\nblock with no inputs and the remaining items are the input values, which\nmay themselves be syntax trees.","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"MAKpVgHu1W"}],"key":"GLK0hWOuWi"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"image","url":"/build/image377-26a4d9e6dd6644bf146815cdcbbc0ad6.png","alt":"image377.png","width":"0.88in","align":"center","key":"ZfgSaLIkaI","urlSource":"images/11-metaprogramming/image377.png"}],"key":"WIBJBCm5GH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Using split by blocks to select custom blocks whose definitions contain\nanother block gives us this debugging aid:","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"f0peJsxDET"}],"key":"ryxgxKlyjU"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"image","url":"/build/image378-9706c1b42155279458dd6066fa975c17.png","alt":"image378.png","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"AVhPThFWaW","urlSource":"images/11-metaprogramming/image378.png"},{"type":"text","value":" ","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"SCPLqGCdKl"},{"type":"comment","value":"  style=\"width:1.15in;height:0.19in\" alt=\"A picture containing text, hitting Description automatically generated\" / ","key":"O1PzinUkkC"}],"key":"uFrEXshw9i"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":46,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note in passing the my blocks block, which\nreports a list of all visible blocks, primitive and custom. (There’s\nalso a my categories block, which reports a\nlist of the names of the palette categories.) Also note custom? of block\n, which reports True if its input is a\ncustom bloc